Exactness contract: pspdb_atrac3.c relies on x87 `long double` (80-bit) and
volatile binary32 stores. Compile it without fast-math or FP contraction. The
build verified the decoder byte-identical to the Sony ACM oracle for a whole
PS1 Classics track (Vib-Ribbon track 02, 28,052,940 PCM bytes).
